          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:252.0649871826172,402.50714111328125,3491.769729614258,1741.6600952148438",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>We wrote down and signed what happened before us in order that it would be a title of right and proof.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;Hanging between the lines: \"A partnership between us, and we owe him a dirha[m],</li>\n<li>altogether all of us. This is established and this is their confirmation:</li>\n<li>Yi\u1e63\u1e25aq b. Shemuel (may his) m(emory be) f(or a blessing) b. Shema\u02bfya he-Haver h(e shall) l(ive a) h(appy life,) a(nd his children shall) i(nherit the) l(and)</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    }
